---
/** 학습 허브 상단 — 인사이트·요일은 DashboardApp이 갱신 */
---
<header
  class="mb-6 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-500/10 bg-[var(--surface-1)] p-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-brand)] sm:p-8"
  data-dashboard-header
>
  <span class="hub-badge hub-badge--primary">나의 학습</span>
  <h1 class="type-title mt-4 brand-gradient-text">오늘의 학습</h1>
  <p class="type-lead chrome-muted mt-3 max-w-2xl" data-dashboard-insight role="status">
    오늘의 학습 흐름을 한눈에 보고, 다음 액션을 빠르게 이어가세요.
  </p>
  <p class="type-caption chrome-muted mt-3" data-dashboard-weekly hidden></p>
  <p class="type-caption chrome-muted mt-1" data-dashboard-sync-hint hidden></p>
</header>
